# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# E-SYLLAB Frontend — Vercel Environment Variables
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# Set these in the Vercel dashboard:
# Project → Settings → Environment Variables
#
# DO NOT commit actual values to GitHub. This file is a reference only.

# Required — your Render backend URL (no trailing slash)
# Used by vite.config.ts to know where the API lives during build
VITE_API_URL=https://e-syllab-api.onrender.com

# Optional — only if you use Gemini AI features in the app
GEMINI_API_KEY=
